// Dialog :
"P4293594148" "So they knew exactly where to ambush that plutonium shipment, huh? Very interesting. Even more interesting is the fact that Crey hasn't reported the theft to the police. That might involve explaining why they had that much plutonium in the first place. It was probably for some government work, but I wish I knew more. The important thing, though, is that the Freakshow don't have it. Good work, {HeroName}."
// RandomFameString :
"P2545977763" "Thanks to {HeroName}, we can all breathe easy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Freakshow_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RiktiWeapons 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3048520277" "Rikti weapons"
// DetailString :
"P223149485" "These plasma-based assault weapons could level a city block within minutes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RiktiDevices 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1914706708" "Rikti devices"
// DetailString :
"P1199763602" "These small devices would have made perfect implants for the Freakshow. They perform a variety of functions, from estimating a target's defenses to enhancing the wearer's physical strength."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RiktiMedicines 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3837653293" "Rikti medicines"
// DetailString :
"P2574486778" "These alien medicines are far beyond the best human science has to offer. They can cure grave wounds within minutes, leaving the recipient fully refreshed and ready for battle."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4068870149" "The Freakshow got wind of a lab in Paragon City that's keeping Rikti technology for study, and they've raided the facility. Alien weapons, armor, and medicines, all gone. Fortunately, one of my contacts was brave enough to trace the Freakshow back to their hideout. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Someone's got to get that Rikti technology away from the Freakshow.</A> As far as I'm concerned, you're the one for the job. you'll about 90 minutes to prove me right."
// AcceptString :
"P2811840734" "Get the Rikti technology away from the Freakshow"
// SendOffString :
"P303692519" "If anyone knows how to abuse high tech weaponry, it's the Freakshow. This could turn into a disaster, and fast. There are two ways to control this situation. First, you could just fight and defeat all the Freakshow in that hideout, and let the city handle the clean-up. Or, you could locate all of the stolen alien technology and take it from the Freaks before they can use it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3494051713" "Retrieve Rikti tech from Freaks"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P510783763" "I don't see any Rikti technology around here, do you? Hurry, the Freakshow still has it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1299413697" "The screams you hear aren't the Freakshow's typical raucous bellows. It sounds like the Freaks are already in a fight for their lives."

