// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3660950874" "Excelsior notes"
// DetailString :
"P3357838098" "These notes detail the process used to make the drug Excelsior, which is responsible for the Freaks' super strength and resistance to pain. According to the notes, the Freakshow is close to perfecting a new, improved version of Excelsior that will make them even more powerful."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3886253010" "I've got a good lead on a plant where the Freakshow are manufacturing Excelsior, the drug that makes them so strong. If we can cut off their drug supply, we might be able to curtail their activities for a while. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you shut down the Freaks' Excelsior plant?</A> I know you can get the job done, but you won't have much time to do it. Maybe 1 hour, tops."
// AcceptString :
"P109575655" "Shut down the Freaks' Excelsior plant"
// SendOffString :
"P2510593671" "Without Excelsior, the Freaks are just a bunch of angry guys with bad haircuts. The Freakshow know that, too, and won't let you get through their numbers. You could take them head on and defeat all the Freaks in there, or you could try concentrating on the Excelsior and taking out the Freak behind this lab and his cronies."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P993973736" "Destroy Freaks' Excelsior plant"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2222486899" "That Excelsior plant is still churning out drugs for the Freakshow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4100757959" "The harsh smell of chemicals pervades this building."

