// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3761066318" "You won't believe what the Freakshow is up to now. They've got some contest running, to see which group of Freaks can torch the most buildings! If we don't put a stop to this, whole sections of the city could go up in flames. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Get out there and put a stop to this Freakshow torching contest!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4058623668" "Put a stop to the Freakshow torching contest"
// SendOffString :
"P2773833231" "It's the Freaks' love of chaos that makes them so dangerous. That, and the cybernetics. And the guns. And their wanton disregard for life and property. Anyway, you'll need to either defeat all the bad guys in each of these places or disarm their firebombs at each site."

