// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Firebombs 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P473571431" "You defeated the villains and put an end to the Freakshow torching contest."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1592975199" "You did a great job, {HeroName}. I'm sure your actions today touched many lives. I'm kind of surprised, though, about those other soldiers you fought. They clearly weren't Freakshow. From what you describe, they were trying to stop the Freakshow too, but then why would they turn around and attack you? It sure doesn't make much sense."
// RandomFameString :
"P1390208960" "My company was almost blown to smithereens. I'm lucky {HeroName} was there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Freakshow_Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - FreakshowMagic 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1642430483" "Technomagic implant"
// DetailString :
"P4270826219" "This steel implant, designed to replace a large section of the forearm, is inscribed with mystic runes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4159761611" "This has got to be the weirdest thing I've heard about the Freakshow all year. Apparently, some Freaks are trying to branch out into techomagic. This can't be good. One of my contacts, Josef Keller, heard a rumor that they're trying to magically enhance their implants. If they succeed, they could become even more dangerous. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to raid a Freakshow hideout and retrieve one of these 'technomagical'  implants.</A> Then take it to Josef; he can help us analyze the threat it poses."
// AcceptString :
"P4123927657" "Raid a Freakshow hideout and retireve one of the new implants"
// SendOffString :
"P2012309458" "If we let the Freakshow get any stronger, we may find that we'll soon be no match for them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Freakshow_Compound2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1747064321" "Retrieve Freak technomagic"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4254548845" "We really need to see that implant, {HeroName}. We need to know what we're dealing with here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P540488492" "The voices of the Freakshow are raised in a unison, chanting the words of a long dead language, with the occasional missed word."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3270458709" "When will the new tech be ready?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2312659111" "I can't wait to get my hands on it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P550938515" "Get lost, chump!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
