// NEGOTIATOR_TWO_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2191266151" "The deal was nearly complete!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3882742259" "Tank Swiper"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P810432801" "Agony Mage"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP_ONE 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP_TWO 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - NEGOTIATOR_ONE_INACTIVE_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// NEGOTIATOR_ONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P595030374" "I don't know about this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - NEGOTIATOR_ONE_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// NEGOTIATOR_ONE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2315639067" "Let's talk about this thorn thing later."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - NEGOTIATOR_TWO_INACTIVE_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// NEGOTIATOR_TWO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1227721105" "The Spirit Thorn is our gift to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - NEGOTIATOR_TWO_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// NEGOTIATOR_TWO_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2525543446" "You've confounded the Circle one time too many, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3288180891" "Triz-Mez"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3976683785" "Tutor Solinar"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1626903573" "You defeated the Freakshow and the Circle of Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2712074253" "So, the Circle was teaching magic to the Freakshow, and giving them Spirit thorns? I've heard that those Spirit thorns can be used by the Circle to take over a body. Maybe that was their plan all along? Circle mystics running around in Freakshow bodies. That's a scary thought, {HeroName}. I'm glad you were on top of things."
// RandomFameString :
"P1564785058" "{HeroName} stopped some bad mojo from going down between the Freakshow and the Circle of Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Freakshow_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1084220406" "There are so many Freakshow out in the city that it's getting impossible for people to live in any kind of safety. The way they've been talking lately, it sounds like they're starting to think that they really can't be held back any longer. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The City's heroes need to defeat a few Freaks to lower their morale.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P360281980" "Hit the streets and defeat a few Freaks"
// SendOffString :
"P1793191391" "I knew you'd be willing to help, {HeroName}. Any Freaks you defeat is a help, whether it's foiling their plans or battling them on the streets. If you are looking for them in the city, you might want to concentrate in Brickstown and Crey's Folly."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P953839591" "Combat Freakshow menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3265342202" "I need you to defeat more Freaks to really have an impact."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1690025486" "You lookin' for us, {HeroName}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P729550561" "You have defeated enough Freakshow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2064473542" "The Freakshow don't learn lessons quickly or remember them well, {HeroName}, but maybe they'll get the message someday. I can only thank you for your constant vigilance until then."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Freakshow_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1407704245" "Brickstown's been having a problem with the Freakshow lately. Freaks are prowling around, no doubt looking over Ziggursky penitentiary looking and thinking of all their fellow freaks incarcerated there. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to help them get a closer look at the Ziggurat. From the inside.</A> The Freakshow's numbers need to be brought down before they try something."
// AcceptString :
"P3562572646" "Defeat Freakshow in Brickstown"
// SendOffString :
"P2686577378" "There are Freaks all over Brickstown, not just in the area around Ziggursky. You could also check out the Crescent district if you're having trouble finding them."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P815650796" "You've got to defeat more Freaks in Brickstown."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2124952841" "You have defeated enough Freakshow in Brickstown."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3639092197" "The Freakshow are going to be hanging around Brickstown for a while, {HeroName}, but thanks to you a lot more of them will be doing so from the inside of the Ziggurat. Well done."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Freakshow_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3267289839" "Crey's Folly is a nightmare, {HeroName}. It's abandoned, polluted, and infested with Freakshow. Now, I don't expect you to be able to help with the pollution, but I think I can ask for your help with the Freakshow. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Could you help out and fight the Freakshow in Crey's Folly?</A> It's a dangerous place, though, so I suggest you go in force."
// AcceptString :
"P2341164125" "Defeat Freakshow in Crey's Folly"
// SendOffString :
"P3422827201" "I don't think you'll have a lot of trouble finding Freakshow, but you might want to concentrate your search in the old Crey Factories and or Tangle Town, but anywhere you can defeat them is good."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2367996904" "Go to Crey's Folly and defeat Freakshow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1121714449" "I've heard rumors that the Freakshow have been setting up forts for themselves out there. I can only wonder how crazy they have to be to even think of that polluted wasteland as a place to hang out."

